  mod_kinds_dll.pcpp - Module compliance: the dll kind (part of mod_kinds.pcpp)

  module dll emits a shared library (BNF.md sec 1): no begin body, the module
  ends with end. alone. Loading and calling a dll is dll_build.pcpp's.

  How to check, from repo\bin:
    pcpp res\tests\mod_kinds_dll.pcpp
    pcpp res\tests\mod_kinds_dll.pcpp -t x86_64-linux-gnu
  The build succeeds and reports nothing.
  CHECK: output\bin holds mod_kinds_dll.dll (windows) or
  libmod_kinds_dll.so (linux)

  Break it: mod_kinds_err_body.pcpp (a begin body where there must be none).
*******************************************************************************/

module dll mod_kinds_dll;

exported routine clink mod_kinds_dll_twice(AX: int32): int32;
begin
  return AX * 2;
end;

end.
